  "title": "How to Make Coquilles Saint-Jacques",
  "description": "Coquilles Saint-Jacques is a delicious scallop dish with a creamy sauce and Gruyère cheese. For something fancy, this is pretty easy to make!",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2013-11-14T16:53:13-05:00",
  "date_modified": "2025-10-14T14:44:49-04:00",
